gpt_5.5_instant/001:
The strategy is a fast, legality-safe Amazons engine for 6x6 play. It generates all legal queen moves and arrow shots, then chooses moves using a mix of:
- immediate win detection, if the opponent has no reply;
- small-board minimax with alpha-beta pruning and time guard;
- territory/mobility evaluation based on reachable squares and available moves;
- arrow preference that blocks opponent mobility while preserving our own.

It always falls back to the first generated legal move if search is interrupted or the position is unusual.
